classDiagram
    %% Source of truth: docs/FINAL_SPEC.md (merged PROJECT_SPECIFICATION.md + Project_Specification_V2.md,
    %% V2 wins on conflicts — see FINAL_SPEC.md's "Conflict Resolutions" table).
    %% Entities below = the 12-table core schema (docs/Database_Design.md, backend/prisma/schema.prisma).
    %% Service classes = FINAL_SPEC.md §2's five cross-cutting services, none of which own a table.
    class Role {
        +String id
        +String name
        +String description
    }
    class User {
        +String id
        +String email
        +String passwordHash
        +String fullName
        +String phone
        +String avatarUrl
        +Boolean isActive
        +DateTime lastLoginAt
        +DateTime createdAt
        +DateTime updatedAt
        +DateTime deletedAt
        +register()
        +login()
        +resetPassword()
    }
    class MembershipPlan {
        +String id
        +String name
        +String description
        +Integer durationDays
        +Integer maxActiveLoans
        +Decimal feeAmount
        +Boolean isActive
    }
    class Membership {
        +String id
        +Date startDate
        +Date endDate
        +String status
        +Boolean autoRenew
        +DateTime createdAt
        +isActive()
        +renew()
    }
    class Book {
        +String id
        +String title
        +String isbn
        +String description
        +Integer publishedYear
        +String language
        +String coverImageUrl
        +DateTime createdAt
        +DateTime updatedAt
        +DateTime deletedAt
        +search()
        +addCopy()
    }
    class BookCopy {
        +String id
        +Integer copyNumber
        +String scanToken
        +String condition
        +Decimal replacementCost
        +String status
        +Date acquiredAt
        +DateTime createdAt
        +markDamaged()
        +markLost()
    }
    class Loan {
        +String id
        +DateTime issuedAt
        +DateTime dueAt
        +DateTime returnedAt
        +Integer renewedCount
        +String status
        +DateTime createdAt
        +issue()
        +returnBook()
        +renew()
        +calculateFine()
    }
    class Reservation {
        +String id
        +Integer queuePosition
        +String status
        +DateTime requestedAt
        +DateTime readyExpiresAt
        +promoteNext()
        +cancel()
    }
    class Seat {
        +String id
        +String seatNumber
        +String zoneLabel
        +String scanToken
        +String status
    }
    class SeatBooking {
        +String id
        +Date bookingDate
        +Time startTime
        +Time endTime
        +String status
        +DateTime checkedInAt
        +DateTime createdAt
        +checkIn()
        +cancel()
    }
    class Payment {
        +String id
        +String type
        +Decimal amount
        +String status
        +String provider
        +String providerReference
        +String relatedEntityType
        +String relatedEntityId
        +DateTime paidAt
        +DateTime createdAt
        +settle()
    }
    class Review {
        +String id
        +Integer rating
        +String body
        +DateTime createdAt
    }

    class NotificationService {
        <<service>>
        +notify(userId, eventType, payload) void
        +listForUser(userId) Notification[]
        +markRead(notificationId) void
        +getPreferences(userId) NotificationPreference
        +updatePreferences(userId, prefs) void
    }
    class AIService {
        <<service>>
        +smartSearch(query) Book[]
        +recommendByMood(userId, mood) Book[]
        +getRecommendations(userId) Book[]
        +askLibrarian(userId, query) String
    }
    class ScanningService {
        <<service>>
        +resolveBookCopy(scanToken) BookCopy
        +resolveSeat(scanToken) Seat
    }
    class AnalyticsService {
        <<service>>
        +getPopularBooks(period) Book[]
        +getRevenueReport(period) Payment[]
        +getOccupancySnapshot(date) SeatBooking[]
        +getOverdueSummary() Loan[]
    }
    class GamificationEngine {
        <<service>>
        +recordEvent(userId, eventType) void
        +getScore(userId) Integer
        +getLeaderboard(limit) User[]
        +getBadges(userId) String[]
    }

    User "many" --> "1" Role : has
    Membership "many" --> "1" User : held by
    Membership "many" --> "1" MembershipPlan : follows
    BookCopy "many" --> "1" Book : copy of
    Loan "many" --> "1" BookCopy : borrows
    Loan "many" --> "1" User : borrowed by (member)
    Loan "many" --> "1" User : issued by (staff)
    Reservation "many" --> "1" Book : queued for
    Reservation "many" --> "1" User : requested by
    SeatBooking "many" --> "1" Seat : books
    SeatBooking "many" --> "1" User : booked by
    Payment "many" --> "1" User : paid by
    Review "many" --> "1" Book : reviews
    Review "many" --> "1" User : written by

    Loan ..> NotificationService : publishes loan due/overdue
    Reservation ..> NotificationService : publishes reservation ready
    SeatBooking ..> NotificationService : publishes booking confirmed
    NotificationService ..> User : delivers to
    AIService ..> Book : searches / recommends
    ScanningService ..> BookCopy : resolves scan_token
    ScanningService ..> Seat : resolves scan_token
    AnalyticsService ..> Loan : aggregates overdue/popular
    AnalyticsService ..> Payment : aggregates revenue
    AnalyticsService ..> SeatBooking : aggregates occupancy
    GamificationEngine ..> Loan : scores borrow activity
    GamificationEngine ..> Review : scores review activity
    GamificationEngine ..> SeatBooking : scores attendance
    GamificationEngine ..> User : ranks

    note for NotificationService "Owns no table (FINAL_SPEC.md §2).\nCross-cutting: other components publish events\nhere instead of sending messages themselves.\nEmail + In-App first (Phase 2), Telegram later\n(Future Scope, Phase 4 per §8)."
    note for AIService "Owns no table. Sits behind a provider abstraction\n(FINAL_SPEC.md §12). Called 'Recommendation Service'\nin §2: one engine, two entry points — tag/mood filter\n(Advanced, Phase 3) and conversational AI Librarian\n(Future Scope, Phase 4 — v1 had it at Milestone 5;\nConflict Resolutions table: v2's phase wins)."
    note for ScanningService "Owns no table — BookCopy.scanToken and Seat.scanToken\nalready carry the token. One resolve endpoint routes by\ntoken type instead of two parallel QR implementations\n(FINAL_SPEC.md §2, Important/Phase 2)."
    note for AnalyticsService "Owns no table — reads pre-aggregated snapshots written\nby scheduled jobs, never live queries (FINAL_SPEC.md §4\nScalability). Consolidates Heatmap + Occupancy + Admin\nReports into one pipeline feeding dashboard widgets\n(Important/Phase 2)."
    note for GamificationEngine "Owns no table of its own — badges and leaderboard rank\nare derived views over each member's Loan/Review/SeatBooking\nactivity, not separate features (FINAL_SPEC.md §2,\nAdvanced/Phase 3)."
    note for Role "Role names per FINAL_SPEC.md §1:\nadmin, librarian, manager, member.\nStored as data rows (dynamic RBAC), not a hardcoded enum.\n§4 recommends evolving this into capability-based\npermissions (can_issue_book, can_waive_fine, ...) later."
